{"ID":"20240228163952-sgpqrnu","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240228163952-sgpqrnu","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240228163952-sgpqrnu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312162731-wy4fcud\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312162731-wod0v0b\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312162731-wod0v0b\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:34,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:34\u0026#125;","title":"【栀子干姜豉汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312162731"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312162731-wy4fcud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162731-wy4fcud","updated":"20240312162731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第八十八条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162731-tx3u3t5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162731-tx3u3t5","updated":"20240312162731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「伤寒」,医以丸药大下之,身热不去,微烦者,「栀子干姜豉汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162731-1b1jxhs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162731-1b1jxhs","updated":"20240312162731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用到干姜就代表里虚掉，虚是寒的虚。中焦上焦之间出现寒，统统会用到干姜。因为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"干姜管中焦上焦，不管下焦。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下焦炮附子在管。肠胃里面寒，寒的定义是，比如内经说一息四至，一呼吸脉跳四下，这是胃气。寒的意思是，你一呼吸跳两下。肺家有寒，我们也可以用干姜。我们用攻下，大部分都是寒凉的药。像大黄、芒硝。下去以后，身热还在那边，表面上的热，实际是虚热，真正里面是寒的。还是用虚热药，干姜来温中。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162731-yxdycjc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162731-yxdycjc","updated":"20240312162731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"恶心用生姜，微烦用干姜。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162731-2c8ubxz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162731-2c8ubxz","updated":"20240312162731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"栀子干姜豉汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312162731-8y97tk0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162731-8y97tk0","updated":"20240312162731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"栀子十四枚劈，干姜二两，香豉四合。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312162731-wod0v0b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162731-wod0v0b","updated":"20240312162731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味,以水三升,煮取一升半,去滓,分二服。栀子四，香豉四，干姜二。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]}]}